# Every tracked file in this repository is LF, and nothing was enforcing that.
#
# A Windows contributor writing a file through a tool that translates newlines commits
# CRLF, and the diff then shows every line of the file as changed. That buries an
# eighteen-line edit inside a hundred and sixty-five, which is unreviewable: the one
# thing a reviewer needs from a diff is to see what actually changed.
#
# Normalise on the way in and check out LF everywhere, so the platform someone happens
# to be working on does not reach the history.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures and captures are bytes. Newline translation corrupts them.
*.png   binary
*.mp4   binary
*.rrd   binary
*.parquet binary
*.stl   binary
*.obj   binary
